# The title and its doors on a desktop: How to play, Settings (the camera
# changed), all modes, the Journey stages, Lessons, the Daily briefing; a
# Practice shift with the action list by the arrow keys, a hint, a shelf's
# actions drawer, undo, the staff drawer, pause, Settings from the pause
# menu, and ending the shift.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 300 All modes
frames 120
save title
click =How to play
until 60 Restock shelves
frames 10
save help
click =Close
until 60 All modes
frames 10
click =Settings
until 60 Color vision
frames 10
save settings
click =Close
until 60 All modes
frames 10
click =Daily market
until 60 Daily Market
frames 10
save daily-setup
click =Back
until 60 All modes
frames 10
click =All modes
