frames 10
save modes
click =Learn
until 60 Lessons
frames 10
save lessons
click =Back
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Practice pace
frames 10
click Practice — Relaxed
until 60 Start shift
frames 10
save practice-setup
click =Start shift
